      "beat_id": "NB01",
      "act": "3 mechanism",
      "narration_text": "Forecast turns your pipeline into one number. You hand it deals — name, amount, stage, close date — plus your quota. Each stage carries a default probability: negotiation eighty percent, discovery twenty. Multiply amount by probability, stage by stage, and add it up. That sum is the weighted forecast.",
